      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A unique case of spontaneous multivessel coronary artery dissection in a young woman without identifiable risk factors, who remained asymptomatic despite extensive coronary dissection is presented. The management of this condition and a review of the current literature on this subject are presented."},
